<title>UK: Ford Credit sets 150 million Sfr four-year bond. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Ford Credit sets 150 million Sfr four-year bond. [CORRECTED 16:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p>(Corrects headline to read &quot;four-year bond&quot; instead of &quot;five-year bond&quot;)</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD CREDIT EUROPE PLC</p>
<p>SUPPORT AGREEMENT  FORD MOTOR CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    29.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.25    PAY DATE    29.JAN.97</p>
<p>(Corrects PAY DATE from 29.JAN.96)</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    EBS	 EOS	   20.DEC.96</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) FIVE	NEG PLG     YES</p>
<p> NOTES	REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
